<title>HONG KONG: Dah Hwa posts sharp fall in interim net.</title>
<headline>Dah Hwa posts sharp fall in interim net.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	0.64   vs 5.95 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) nil    vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			 3.31   vs 30.08</p>
<p>    Turnover		  257.01 vs 255.75</p>
<p>    Company name	    Dah Hwa International (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Dah Hwa International is a garment leather trader and distributor. Comparative share earnings adjusted for subdivision of shares made in January 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
